  "title": "Hardening Windows: Security Foundations Developers Can Build On",
  "description": "Security assumptions are changing faster than most apps are built to handle. In this session, learn how Windows is raising the security foundation by reducing attack surface and preparing for the post‑quantum future. We’ll walk through Post‑Quantum Cryptography, moving authentication from NTLM to Kerberos, and stricter driver trust policies with live demos, so you know what’s changing, how it affects your apps, and what to do next.",
